{"title": "Stealthier", "pageid": 28185, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stealthier", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Stealthier</b> is a passive feature that helps the wearer hide and move undetected while in shadow.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a>, the wearer gains a +3 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> Checks. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Shadow_StealthBonusWhileObscured_Armor_Passive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Shadow_StealthBonusWhileObscured_Armor_Passive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Shadow_StealthBonusWhileObscured_Armor_Passive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Stealthier\"> Condition: Stealthier </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stealthier_(Condition)\" title=\"Stealthier (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stealthier\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stealthier_(Condition)\" title=\"Stealthier (Condition)\">Stealthier</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>As long as affected entity remains obscured, it has a +3 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> Checks.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Penumbral_Armour\" title=\"Penumbral Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Penumbral_Armour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawle